    guide = f'''<section class="container article-layout"><article class="article-main"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/directory/">Directory</a> / {e(x['category'])}</div><h1 class="article-title">{title}</h1><p class="article-lead">{e(x['summary'])}</p><div class="article-meta"><span class="meta-pill">{e(x['category'])}</span><span class="meta-pill">{e(x['difficulty'])}</span><span class="meta-pill">Estimated first setup: {e(x['time'])}</span><span class="meta-pill">Tool: {e(x['tool'])}</span></div><div class="btn-row"><button class="button secondary small" data-save="{slug}" data-title="{title}" aria-pressed="false" type="button">♡ Save</button><button class="button secondary small" data-copy="" type="button">Copy guide link ↗</button></div><h2>What you can accomplish</h2><p>{e(x['outcome'])}</p><h2>Your first build: step by step</h2><ol class="steps-list">{step_html}</ol><h2>What to watch out for</h2><div class="notice"><strong>Practical caution:</strong> {e(x['caution'])}</div><h2>How to evaluate the result</h2><p>Run a small test on representative inputs. Check accuracy, the time it actually saves, whether a person can correct mistakes, and whether the workflow achieves the intended outcome. Increase automation only after you can explain how failures are detected and handled.</p><p class="source-details">Editor's note: The workflow is an Agent Lab implementation suggestion, not a vendor-endorsed tutorial. Setup times are editorial estimates; actual work varies by tool, account access, and complexity.</p></article><aside><div class="sidebox"><span class="eyebrow">Field notes</span><h3>Who this is for</h3><p>{e(x['audience'])}</p><h3>Suggested toolkit</h3><p>{e(x['tool'])}</p><h3>Source documentation</h3><p>Review the product's own documentation before setting anything up.</p><a class="external" href="{e(x['source'])}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{e(x['source_label'])} ↗</a><a class="button secondary" href="/directory/">← Back to the directory</a></div></aside></section><section class="feature-band"><div class="container feature-band-inner"><div><div class="eyebrow">More to explore</div><h2>One useful workflow leads to another.</h2><p>Explore the directory for other ways to apply AI to everyday work.</p></div><a class="button primary" href="/directory/">Find another use case ↗</a></div></section>'''
    dest=ROOT/'guides'/x['slug']; dest.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)
    (dest/'index.html').write_text(layout(x['title'],x['summary'],'',guide),encoding='utf-8')

